      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During World War I, East Chicago earned the nicknames \"Arsenal of America\" and \"Workshop of America\" for its booming steel and rail industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
