      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Chicago%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Indiana Harbor Ship Canal runs through East Chicago, giving the city a freshwater harbor that links to Lake Michigan.",
